Derived parts: the self-hosted Langfuse observability pattern — ECS Fargate
(Langfuse web + worker), Aurora PostgreSQL Serverless v2, ClickHouse, ElastiCache
Redis, and a CloudFront + Application Load Balancer edge — together with the dual
AWS-native + embedded-Langfuse observability approach.

Modifications have been made to integrate with the Enterprise Agentic AI Platform
(powered by Amazon Bedrock AgentCore). See ATTRIBUTION.md in this directory for
details.
